  "Membership and gifts make our work possible.Join Us",
  "We use our own and third-party cookies for the basic functionality of this website and to personalize your experience. By visiting our website or transacting with us, you agree to this. To find out more including how to ",
  "The new Eames Archives offers more opportunities to explore the objects, processes, and ideas within the Eames Collection, inviting visitors to discover unexpected connections and new perspectives.",
  "By sharing their approach to life and work, we advance the legacy of designers Ray and Charles Eames⁠—and inspire creative problem-solving that positively shapes our world.",
  "Your membership helps us carry forward the Eameses’ spirit of curiosity and craft as we build a museum for the next generation of designers, thinkers, and makers.",
  "The Eames Institute continues a time-honored tradition with a poster for our annual Friends & Family Summer Picnic, inspired by Steve Frykholm’s iconic designs for Herman Miller.",
  "We celebrate a growing community of thinkers, makers, and doers whose work reflects the spirit of curiosity in action. Discover the people and ideas shaping what comes next.",
  "With the launch of our first annual Impact Report, 2025 marked a year of significant growth, experimentation, and community-building. Discover how curiosity moved us forward.",
